  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa7628b10414b438",
      "translationZh": "我一直在与典型的双路问题较劲：总有一半的核心要通过互连读取权重。在我的机器上（2x EPYC 7532，NPS1），本地读取带宽为 137 GB/s，而跨插槽读取只有 47.7 GB/s，所以第二个插槽基本上不值它的成本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d49f058f98e9b07",
      "translationZh": "于是，我把 ggml-cpu.h 中一直闲置的 GGML_NUMA_STRATEGY_MIRROR 枚举接入了实现：在每个 NUMA 节点上保留一份完整的大型权重副本，让每个线程从自己所在节点的副本中读取。代价是权重占用的 RAM 变为 2x，换来的是这些核心终于能发挥作用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64f0348c17f9ba8d",
      "translationZh": "llama-bench 的测试数据如下，使用同一个二进制文件，只将 --numa distribute 改为 --numa mirror，每组测试都进行冷加载，使用 numactl --membind=0：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6167ee6d80b432e",
      "translationZh": "GLM-5.2 Q3\\_K\\_XL（319 GiB），相同配置：4.97 → 8.49（+71%）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21f4c3e277c7c4ba",
      "translationZh": "gemma-4-31B Q4\\_0 稠密模型，纯 CPU 解码：3.32 → 7.88（+137%）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
